 "traps": [
  "three units carry frameworks: the Python project paperless-ngx, the npm package paperless-ngx-ui in src-ui and a nameless package.json in src/paperless_mail/templates that only holds Tailwind CSS",
  "the compose broker is Valkey (valkey/valkey:9-alpine), while the devcontainer starts redis:7 and the code talks to it through the redis client and PAPERLESS_REDIS",
  "PostgreSQL, MariaDB and SQLite are alternatives chosen by PAPERLESS_DBENGINE or PAPERLESS_DBHOST; SQLite is the default when nothing is set",
  "Tika and Gotenberg appear only in the -tika compose files and CI; GreenMail and nginx appear only in docker-compose.ci-test.yml, as the IMAP server and the static file server of the tests",
  "the AI back ends (OpenAI-like, Ollama, Hugging Face embeddings) and Azure AI Document Intelligence are reached only when PAPERLESS_AI_LLM_BACKEND or PAPERLESS_REMOTE_OCR_ENGINE select them",
  "pytest lives in the dependency group testing, and Jest runs through the Angular builder @angular-builders/jest",
  "social login through django-allauth names no provider in the repository: providers come from PAPERLESS_SOCIALACCOUNT_PROVIDERS at run time",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
